stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Review: submit
  note right of Review: a person checks it
  state check <<choice>>
  Review --> check
  check --> Approved: ok
  check --> Draft: changes requested
  state fork1 <<fork>>
  Approved --> fork1
  fork1 --> Build
  fork1 --> Docs
  state join1 <<join>>
  Build --> join1
  Docs --> join1
  join1 --> Released
  Build --> Build: retry
  Build --> Failed: error
  Failed --> [*]
  Released --> [*]
